{"text": "Sure, I'll think outside the box!", "start": 0, "end": 33, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "How about we manipulate the numbers to get 24?", "start": 34, "end": 80, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "Consider this: (12 * (10 - 8)) + 1.", "start": 81, "end": 116, "label": "request"}
